<li id="S4.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="S4.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hydrate Details for Reporting (Agent Logic):</span> The returned <span id="S4.I3.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ImpactReport</span> contains lightweight lists of identifiers. To build a rich, human-readable narrative, the agent "hydrates" these IDs into full objects using efficient batch calls.</p>
<div id="S4.I3.i3.p1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
