_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx64.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">change_date</span><span id="lstnumberx64.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx64.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">-</span><span id="lstnumberx64.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx64.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">1</span><span id="lstnumberx64.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx64.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">second</span>
</div>
